            0.881,
            0.871
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Observe how these two formulas are special cases of the formulas 2(wl + hl + hw) and whl, when "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "w = h = l ,"
